flowchart TD
  U[Shopper request] --> A[AI agent - Claude API<br/>no payment credentials]
  A -->|structured proposal| G1{PoS gate: PROPOSE}
  G1 -->|REJECT| X[Blocked and logged]
  G1 -->|ACT_NOW| H[Human confirms exact item + amount]
  H --> G2{PoS gate: CREATE_ORDER}
  G2 -->|REJECT| X
  G2 -->|ACT_NOW, one attempt| P[PayPal Sandbox order]
  P --> B[Buyer approves in PayPal]
  B --> S[App reads order status from PayPal]
  S --> G3{PoS gate: CAPTURE}
  G3 -->|WAIT or REJECT| X
  G3 -->|ACT_NOW| C[Capture, accepted only if PayPal confirms COMPLETED and the approved amount]
  C --> L[(Evidence ledger: SQLite + SHA-256 chain<br/>every step above is recorded)]
  X --> L
  subgraph Gate implementations
    D[Demo policy adapter - public, in this repo]
    R[Private Proof-of-Silence gateway - optional, not in this repo]
  end
